        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ADRIFT you find yourself behind the wheel, in the middle of nowhere, in possession of only one goal - deliver the Energy Core. Why, where and how are but questions that dance in your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out in your off-road truck as you drift through winding canyons, accelerate along sand dunes, and handbrake turn your way through rocky plains in a world which has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.poster.avif?t=1767977790\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.webm?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.mp4?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CARGO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock. Make sure to explore and plan your route before racing to your next safe haven. Every second the mysterious Energy Core spends in the desert heat is a second closer to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.poster.avif?t=1767977790\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.webm?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.mp4?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THOUSAND JOURNEYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the serenity of a long-forgotten desert, discover what happened to this land, craft shortcuts, and plot your own route through a top-down vaporwave-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.poster.avif?t=1767977790\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.webm?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.mp4?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ADRIFT you find yourself behind the wheel, in the middle of nowhere, in possession of only one goal - deliver the Energy Core. Why, where and how are but questions that dance in your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out in your off-road truck as you drift through winding canyons, accelerate along sand dunes, and handbrake turn your way through rocky plains in a world which has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.poster.avif?t=1767977790\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.webm?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/01a67f5e6bffbe00fdb921ef093e3c20.mp4?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CARGO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock. Make sure to explore and plan your route before racing to your next safe haven. Every second the mysterious Energy Core spends in the desert heat is a second closer to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.poster.avif?t=1767977790\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.webm?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/2993fd5ccfb7bec13d52861bace56f8b.mp4?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THOUSAND JOURNEYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the serenity of a long-forgotten desert, discover what happened to this land, craft shortcuts, and plot your own route through a top-down vaporwave-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.poster.avif?t=1767977790\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.webm?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/0b9651084fc6914b29887b9cf40ec8ed.mp4?t=1767977790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Drift away in the serenity of the desert. Carry your fragile cargo across a top-down world, and discover fragments from a time before. Untwine labyrinthian roads, where sweeping dunes make way for twisting canyons, and find oases in which to plan. Where will your journey take you?",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“Warm up your graphics cards, check your virtual tire pressure, and prepare to be immersed in a world where danger meets breathtaking aesthetics.”<br>La Pause Geek<br><br>“The game promises an exciting blend of exploration, physics-based gameplay, and a neon-drenched atmosphere”<br>Spiele Magazin<br><br>“Adrift is an upcoming &quot;offroad vaporwave racer&quot; that is, clear as daylight, powered by pure vibes, with a retro-inspired palette that may resonate with people who are interested in relatively lo-fi driving games like Art of Rally—games more about the feel of driving than ultra-hi-res landscapes and cars.”<br>PC Gamer<br>",
